                     ---------------------------------
                              SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
                     ---------------------------------

The BSD-2-Clause terms above cover only this repository's own packaging
material: the scripts (gen.sh, mkrepo.sh), the CI workflows, the
documentation, and the package template sources under srcpkg/.

They do NOT cover the software those materials build or distribute.

  * The Linux kernel built by this package -- including the AsahiLinux
    `fairydust` branch it is built from, and every binary package
    (*.xbps) published from it, such as those on the
    `repository-aarch64` branch -- is licensed GPL-2.0-only. Nothing in
    this file grants or restricts any right in that code; its own
    license governs.

  * Corresponding source for the published binary packages is the exact
    upstream commit pinned in srcpkg/header.in (the `_commit` variable),
    fetched from the `distfiles` URL recorded alongside it. The build
    inputs used to produce those binaries -- the template, the kernel
    configuration in srcpkg/linux-asahi-fairydust/files/, and the
    patches in srcpkg/patches/ -- are committed in this repository, and
    srcpkg/UPSTREAM records the void-packages revision they were
    generated from.
